OL,3,GNEWSAEx-inmates 'dying without justice'
OL,4,Aover abuse claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer inmates who say they were abused
OL,7,Fas teenagers at a detention centre are
OL,8,Fdying without seeing justice, an MP has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FCleveland Police said more than 900 men
OL,12,Fhad contacted it to say they suffered
OL,13,Fphysical and sexual abuse at
OL,14,FKirklevington Detention Centre between
OL,15,Fthe 1960s and early 1990s.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
