OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAEx-inmates 'dying without justice'
OL,4,Aover abuse claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has been running for
OL,7,F12 years but no former prison officer
OL,8,Fhas yet faced any charges. Conservative
OL,9,FMP for Stockton West Matt Vickers said
OL,10,Fit was "unbelievable" some men who had
OL,11,Fsuffered and had the bravery to report
OL,12,Fthe abuse to the authorities "were now
OL,13,Fdying without ever seeing justice".
OL,15,FCleveland Police said it was "acutely
OL,16,Faware" of how long the investigation
OL,17,Fhad taken.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
